  <tag k="description" v="Sand facing the Tasman Sea, dense bush (forests), steep hills and fast-rising rivers contrast with towns facing the Pacific Ocean. Challenges: cross tidal estuaries - choices - wait for low tide, pack float, appeal to a friendly boatie or find a bypass."/>
